# Agent instructions. NOT tracked, and the omission is deliberate.
# This repo is public because GitHub Pages only serves public repos, and Pages serves the repo
# root — so a tracked CLAUDE.md was readable at anthonyhdd.github.io/kamo/CLAUDE.md by anyone
# who asked, crawlers included. It carried the unit economics, the account ids, and the two
# founder gestures with the shape of PASS_HASH. Removed from every commit on 2026-09-10.
# Keep the file on disk; never let `git add -A` put it back.
CLAUDE.md
